name: {{LOOP_NAME}}
description: >
  Drive an agent until seed/status.json reports {"ready": true}. The gate
  is seed/check.py — a tiny stdlib-only checker shipped with the loop, so it
  runs anywhere Python does: no network, no API key. Ships a deliberately
  broken starting file so there is something concrete to fix on lap 1.
pattern: evaluator-optimizer
role:
  - engineering
rung: L1
spec: PROMPT.md
# The gate checker (seed/check.py) and the ground-truth schema it applies are
# the anchors — the agent fixes the data file, never the checker.
forbid:
  - "seed/check.py"
runner:
  default: stub
gate:
  kind: command
  run: "python3 seed/check.py"
bounds: bounds.yaml
memory: STATE.md
